<!--
===============================================================================
AntiMicroX + 8BitDo Ultimate 2C + Steam Input Compatibility

This profile maps the 8BitDo Ultimate 2C for use with OpenCode TUI navigation.

STEAM INPUT COMPATIBILITY NOTICE:
- When Steam is running with this controller connected, Steam Input will likely
  seize the device in exclusive mode. AntiMicroX will not receive input events
  while Steam Input is active.
- For OpenCode use: launch OpenCode/AntiMicroX WITHOUT Steam running, or quit
  Steam Input first.
- To use Steam's on-screen keyboard: use Steam+X (Home + X on the controller)
  outside of Steam Input, or configure a Steam Input layout separately.
- The profile below assumes the controller is in Switch mode (default for
  8BitDo Ultimate 2C wireless). For XInput mode, button codes may differ.
===============================================================================
EOF